## Resolved mutable: m-terrain-missing-inbrowser-cause

browser-66/67 live: terrain config reaches client identically on :3001 and :8090 (worldConfig.terrain enabled/radius/anchorDir/veg all equal). The divergence is the terrain BUILD: createTerrainBackdrop (client/core/TerrainBackdrop.js) inits the mapspinner planet GPU by fetching shaders+textures with a 3-attempt retry (TerrainBackdrop.js:62-90); on a COLD cache first-load under the slow in-browser BrowserServer worker boot, all 3 attempts lose the fetch race -> returns the no-op fallback that does NOT set window.__terrain -> app.js:198 skips veg/rocks/grass -> flat sky, 'only parts display'. Measured: 6 cold loads on :8090, run 0 (coldest) FAILED, runs 1-5 (warm cache) succeeded = ~1/6, biased to first-visit. :3001 CLI StaticHandler serves instantly so the race never loses. Not a config/asset-404 issue; a cold-first-load fetch-race timeout.